name    mod-kill-collector: first kills pay a token, the party collects too
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Needs KillCollector.Enable = 1 and this folder in
# TestBots.ScenarioDirs.
#
# A mage and a priest in one party: the mage kills, the priest only stands next to the creature.
# 1. The first Snapjaw (2408, the Hillsbrad river) pays both a Hunter's Token (920200) and counts as
#    collected for both.
# 2. A second Snapjaw (the same entry) pays nothing.
# 3. A Rot Hide Brute (1939, Silverpine, a new entry) pays both again.
# The places and the kill (three triggered Arcane Explosions, 42921, after `approach` and a `wait 1s`)
# come from mod-loot-filter's scenario. `.killcollector reset` (the director, the selected bot) empties
# each bot's collection first, `destroy` its tokens, so every run starts from nothing.
timeout 240s

bot a mage
bot h priest
group party

place 0 -217.3 -1112.8 36.5
require a alive
require h alive
do gm target a
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"
do gm target h
as gm .killcollector reset
expect output has "collection reset"
do a destroy 920200
do h destroy 920200

log 1 - a first kill pays the killer and the party member next to it
pick t1 creature:2408 near a
require t1 alive
do a approach t1
do h approach t1
wait 1s
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
waitfor t1 dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
expect a item 920200 == 1
expect h item 920200 == 1
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "1 different creatures killed"
as h .killcollector status
expect output has "1 different creatures killed"

log 2 - the same creature again pays nothing
place 0 -89.6 -1107.8 36.2
pick t2 creature:2408 near a
require t2 alive
do a approach t2
do h approach t2
wait 1s
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
waitfor t2 dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
expect a item 920200 == 1
expect h item 920200 == 1

log 3 - a new creature pays again
place 0 705 610 45
pick g1 creature:1939 near a
require g1 alive
do a approach g1
do h approach g1
wait 1s
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
do a cast 42921 triggered
waitfor g1 dead timeout 5s
wait 1s
expect a item 920200 == 2
expect h item 920200 == 2
as a .killcollector status
expect output has "2 different creatures killed"

cleanup
do a destroy 920200
do h destroy 920200
log kill collector tokens done
